   "n": 3,
   "text": "$\\int_{2}^{4}f(x)dx=2 \\int_{1}^{2}f(2 t)dt=4 \\int_{1}^{2}g(t)dt=7$ , $\\int_{2}^{4}g(x)dx=16-4-7=5$",
